select pg_temp.seed_phase18_step('bridge_contacts_thickness','bridge_analysis',10,'Check static relationships and thickness','Proverite statičke odnose i debljinu',
 'Run Proximity map for the bridge against an adjacent tooth and then against the antagonist. Run Thickness on the bridge and inspect a Section view. Values are exercise measurements only.',
